OL,3,GNEWSAForget the Mediterranean diet, I'm
OL,4,Aeating nothing but food from Shetland
OL,5,Afor a month
OL,6,
OL,7,FCould you survive a month eating only
OL,8,Ffood produced in your local area?
OL,10,FIt would be difficult enough to do in a
OL,11,Fcity, town or village on the mainland.
OL,12,FDr Alex Armitage is doing it in
OL,13,FShetland.
OL,15,FAs part of Shetland Food Month, the
OL,16,Fconsultant paediatrician has set
OL,17,Fhimself the challenge of surviving on
OL,18,Fjust local produce for the month of
OL,19,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
