OL,3,GNEWSAForget the Mediterranean diet, I'm
OL,4,Aeating nothing but food from Shetland
OL,5,Afor a month
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe's already been out in his kayak to
OL,8,Fcatch fish, he's been foraging for
OL,9,Fmushrooms and berries, and he's enjoyed
OL,10,Fvegetables from his neighbour's croft.
